            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rabidja's Revenge is a retro handheld platformer in Pixel Art. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Rabidja, the rabbit ninja seller from the Aron franchise, published on Xbox 360 by Meruvia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through 20 levels including forests, seashores, underwater depths, gloomy caves, fly in the sky and explores the dark castle of the sinister Professor to get back the golden pieces he stole from you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/523630/extras/8b5beed1f893462718ff6b4f66a5dd8d.avif?t=1761257436\" width=500 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new modern / retro platformer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 fun and originals levels through 5 different worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/523630/extras/787df3f1fc2926edef2c5e76120adf24.poster.avif?t=1761257436\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/523630/extras/787df3f1fc2926edef2c5e76120adf24.webm?t=1761257436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/523630/extras/787df3f1fc2926edef2c5e76120adf24.mp4?t=1761257436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 mean bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, swim or even fly in an airplane! (platforming + shooting stages).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw shuriken, as a good ninja, but beware! It won't kill ghosts...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funny graphics and story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 hidden Golden Pieces to find.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 bonus levels to unlock.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/523630/extras/9628b746ba7fc3ff0b6aaa24c93a8d02.poster.avif?t=1761257436\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/523630/extras/9628b746ba7fc3ff0b6aaa24c93a8d02.webm?t=1761257436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/523630/extras/9628b746ba7fc3ff0b6aaa24c93a8d02.mp4?t=1761257436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A retro challenging game but not frustrating thanks to infinite lives and an auto-save system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can download the ROM and play on your favorite emulator / handheld.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/523630/extras/8a2f10a4a90c4b20a8e28b6e25b0b47b.avif?t=1761257436\" width=500 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/523630/extras/b09d5495fc11ce0b77c5be7e41e50458.avif?t=1761257436\" width=600 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/523630/extras/55e8c6d0f2dfad4c50ed3410bc5d8354.avif?t=1761257436\" width=500 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can  play the game directly on Steam or download the ROM to play it on real harware or emulators! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For that, click on <strong>&quot;Browse Local Files&quot;</strong> on the game to go to the game's files, go to the <strong>&quot;Goodies&quot;</strong> directory to find the Roms and the digital manual. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/523630/extras/e20f2d7b286e1e10953eb1abcd02fce3.avif?t=1761257436\" width=350 height=211 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/523630/extras/ecfe7fac83e0aaa1602d4147550b72df.avif?t=1761257436\" width=500 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game development / Art:</strong> The Indie Meruvia Team</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music:</strong> Beatscribe for the catchy tunes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Made with GB Studio 4</strong> by Chris Maltby and <strong>Platformer+</strong> by Hauntology</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steamdeck Version thanks to <strong>GodotBoy</strong> by GreenF0x</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/523630/extras/684a74f01927fef20fdf57894e57e45e.avif?t=1761257436\" width=350 height=131 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We took a great pleasure to create the game, with a lot of love, patience and laughs. You can try to find all the little references to known video-games in it (or to our previous games).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    We hope you will enjoy the game as much as we did developping it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >       Have fun! :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/523630/extras/8dc93243144b9762c995d13eb483b6b7.avif?t=1761257436\" width=300 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>",
