ken, as a good ninja, but beware! It won't kill ghosts...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funny graphics and story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 hidden Golden Pieces to find.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 bonus levels to unlock.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/523630/extras/9628b746ba7fc3ff0b6aaa24c93a8d02.poster.avif?t=1761257436\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/523630/extras/9628b746ba7fc3ff0b6aaa24c93a8d02.webm?t=1761257436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/523630/extras/9628b746ba7fc3ff0b6aaa24c93a8d02.mp4?t=1761257436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A retro challenging game but not frustrating thanks to infinite lives and an auto-save system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can download the ROM and play on your favorite emulator / handheld.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/523630/extras/8a2f10a4a90c4b20a8e28b6e25b0b47b.avif?t=1761257436\" width=500 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/523630/extras/b09d5495fc11ce0b77c5be7e41e50458.avif?t=1761257436\" width=600 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"