tem_assets/steam/apps/523630/extras/684a74f01927fef20fdf57894e57e45e.avif?t=1761257436\" width=350 height=131 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We took a great pleasure to create the game, with a lot of love, patience and laughs. You can try to find all the little references to known video-games in it (or to our previous games).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    We hope you will enjoy the game as much as we did developping it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >       Have fun! :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/523630/extras/8dc93243144b9762c995d13eb483b6b7.avif?t=1761257436\" width=300 height=267 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>",
